## H.2.1 Automatic workloads-aware OP reordering  

We evaluate the performance improvements due to our probe- based OP reordering on two recipes with different numbers of OPs. The simple recipe contains 5 OPs, with 2 fusible OPs, while the complex recipe includes 13 OPs, with 5 fusible OPs. We run these recipes on the base dataset used before (560k image- text pairs), comparing processing times for all OPs, fusible OPs, and other OPs.  

